#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Initialize the service in an untrusted environment {#initialize-the-service-"
"in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Initialiser le service dans un environnement non fiable {#initialize-the-"
"service-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these instructions if you are working with IBM Cloud or the IBM "
"Qiskit Runtime REST API in an untrusted environment, such as a public "
"computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Suis ces instructions si tu travailles avec IBM Cloud ou l'API REST IBM "
"Qiskit Runtime dans un environnement non fiable, comme un ordinateur "
"public.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Avoid executing code on an untrusted machine or an external cloud Python "
"environment to minimize security risks.** If you must use an untrusted "
"environment (on, for example, a shared or public computer), change your API "
"key after each use by deleting it on the [API keys "
"page](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) and creating a new one.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Évite d'exécuter du code sur une machine non fiable ou dans un "
"environnement cloud Python externe afin de minimiser les risques de "
"sécurité.** Si tu dois utiliser un environnement non fiable (par exemple, "
"sur un ordinateur partagé ou public), change ta clé API après chaque "
"utilisation en la supprimant sur la [page des clés "
"API](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) et en en créant une nouvelle.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Protect your API key!** Never include your key in source code, Python script, or notebook file. When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the token and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Protège ta clé API !** N'inclus jamais ta clé dans du code source, un script Python ou un fichier notebook. Lorsque tu partages du code avec d'autres personnes, assure-toi que ta clé API n'est pas intégrée directement dans le script Python. À la place, partage le script sans le token et fournis des instructions pour le configurer de manière sécurisée.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by following the [Deleting an API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) instructions on IBM Cloud.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"      Si tu partages accidentellement ta clé avec quelqu'un ou si tu l'inclus dans un système de contrôle de version comme Git, révoque immédiatement ta clé en suivant les instructions [Suppression d'une clé API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) sur IBM Cloud.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Trouver tes identifiants d'accès {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find your API key (also referred to as an  _API token_). From the "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy "
"it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. The token will"
" not be visible again. Note that you can use a single API key to connect to "
"any region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Trouve ta clé API (également appelée _token API_). Depuis le [tableau de "
"bord](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), crée ta clé API, puis copie-la dans "
"un endroit sécurisé afin de pouvoir l'utiliser pour l'authentification. Le "
"token ne sera plus visible ensuite. Note que tu peux utiliser une seule clé "
"API pour te connecter à n'importe quelle région.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its "
"CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can"
" use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Facultatif : Trouve l'instance que tu souhaites utiliser depuis la page "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Passe la souris sur "
"son CRN, clique sur l'icône pour le copier, puis enregistre-le dans un "
"endroit sécurisé afin de pouvoir l'utiliser pour identifier l'instance.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Authenticate to IBM Cloud in an untrusted environment {#authenticate-to-ibm-"
"cloud-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr ""
"S'authentifier auprès d'IBM Cloud dans un environnement non fiable "
"{#authenticate-to-ibm-cloud-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To initialize the service in this situation, use code like the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour initialiser le service dans cette situation, utilise un code similaire "
"à celui-ci :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # The credentials you enter will override any saved\n"
"    # account credentials that might be available locally.\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(\n"
"      # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from\n"
"      # the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard, and then delete\n"
"      # the key on the API keys page after entering this code:\n"
"      token=\"<your-API-key>\", \n"
msgstr ""
"    # The credentials you enter will override any saved\n"
"    # account credentials that might be available locally.\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(\n"
"      # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from\n"
"      # the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard, and then delete\n"
"      # the key on the API keys page after entering this code:\n"
"      token=\"<your-API-key>\",\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Optionally specify an instance to use\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\"\n"
"      )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Optionally specify an instance to use\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\"\n"
"      )\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"rest-untrusted\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"rest-untrusted\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Authenticate to the REST API in an untrusted environment {#authenticate-to-"
"the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr ""
"S'authentifier auprès de l'API REST dans un environnement non fiable "
"{#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to use your API key directly to authenticate to the "
"Qiskit Runtime REST API, where `<your_API_KEY>` is the 44-character API key "
"you created and saved from your IBM Quantum Platform dashboard.\n"
msgstr ""
"Suis ces étapes pour utiliser ta clé API directement afin de t'authentifier "
"auprès de l'API REST Qiskit Runtime, où `<your_API_KEY>` est la clé API de "
"44 caractères que tu as créée et enregistrée depuis ton tableau de bord IBM "
"Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use your API key to generate a [bearer "
"token](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest#authentication)."
" A _bearer token_ is a temporary credential that expires after no more than "
"one hour. After the acquired token expires, you must generate a new one to "
"continue calling IBM Cloud or other service APIs. :\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise ta clé API pour générer un [bearer "
"token](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest#authentication)."
" Un _bearer token_ est un identifiant temporaire qui expire après une heure "
"au maximum. Une fois le token acquis expiré, tu dois en générer un nouveau "
"pour continuer à appeler IBM Cloud ou d'autres API de service. :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Copy and save the returned bearer token:  `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
"  1. Authenticate requests to the Qiskit Runtime REST API by including the CRN and bearer token in the request's headers.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Copie et enregistre le bearer token retourné : `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
"  1. Authentifie les requêtes vers l'API REST Qiskit Runtime en incluant le CRN et le bearer token dans les en-têtes de la requête.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```bash\n"
"      curl -X 'GET' \\\n"
"        'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/usage' \\\n"
"        '-H accept: application/json' \\\n"
"        '-H authorization: Bearer <BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"        '-H Service-CRN: <INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```bash\n"
"      curl -X 'GET' \\\n"
"        'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/usage' \\\n"
"        '-H accept: application/json' \\\n"
"        '-H authorization: Bearer <BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"        '-H Service-CRN: <INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"      ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Change your API key after each use by [Deleting your existing API "
"key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) and generating a new API key on the"
" [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) home page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Change ta clé API après chaque utilisation en [supprimant ta clé API "
"existante](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) et en générant une nouvelle clé API"
" sur la page d'accueil d'[IBM Quantum "
"Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

